	<weather_page>
		<!-- The periods page: a row per level (templ_level, its caption cap_level) with the weather of
		     its good and its bad period (list_period_good, list_period_bad); the column captions
		     cap_period_good and cap_period_bad sit in the subsection's header, which grows to hold
		     them. The weather_dialog nodes are the stock page's. -->
